01:01:12.460 --> 01:01:21.220
<v Tug>I just want to say you are kind and-- you are so kind, and sweet, and nice. And you are a great person.
<v Tug>我只想说你很善良，而且……你真的很善良、甜美、友好。你是个很棒的人。

